window.products.push({"id":622009,"name":"Kitchen Storage Cart Microwave Stand on Wheels Rolling Utility Cart with Storage Basket Slim Storage Trolley for Kitchen, Bathroom, Living Room, Offic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hKf9eMFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Rolling Storage Cart】: The 4 tier kitchen rolling utility cart consists of 2 pull-out baskets, 1 mesh platform and a top wooden board, which helps to storage fruits, vegetables, books, towels, toilet papers or display toys, etc. The ideal size and movable features make this freestanding rolling storage cart suitable for apartments, dorms, craft rooms, garages, etc. 【Sturdy Construction】: Product size: 19\"L x 12\"W x 35.4\"H. The 4 tier slim kitchen storage cart is made of of premium metal and particleboard material, which make the storage trolley sturdy, durable, anti-rust, easy to clean and can hold up to 80lbs.(each pull-put basket can hold up to 11 pounds and 50 pounds for the top wood board) It is indeed an ideal storage solution for your home. 【Movable & Detachable】: Our microwave stand is equipped with 4 rolling wheels (2 lockable), 4 adjustable rubber mats, and a metal handle to make it more convenient to move or keep the storage cart in place (the metal handle can also be used to hang towel in the bathroom) . Additionally, the 2 wire baskets are detachable and can also be used in kitchen condiment rack, under sink, or bathroom as you like. 【Easy Assembly & Cleaning】:The detailed instructions and mounting accessories are provided. The assemble process would only take you a few minutes and then you will get a beautiful and practical kitchen storage cart. What’s more, the waterproof surface makes cleaning easier, you can wipe dirty stains with a wet cloth. 【Excellent Customer Service】:OYEAL Direct offers premium quality and the best service. If you encounter any problems( damaged product or missing parts, etc.) before or after your purchase of the 3 tier rolling storage utility cart, please feel free to contact us and we will give you a satisfactory solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hKf9eMFdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OYEAL","source_asin":"B0B3X3D9FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3X3D9FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3X3D9FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
