window.products.push({"id":622041,"name":"Stock Your Home Liter Glass Milk Bottles (2 Pack) - 32-Oz Milk Jars with Lids - Food Grade Glass Bottles - Dishwasher Safe - Bottles for Milk, Butterm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715MDl5vwpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sustainable & Made in the USA: Made of premium quality, lead-free material, our crystal clear glass jugs are a great alternative to acrylic or plastic containers. Our milk bottles with lids are also recyclable and reusable. Tamper Proof Caps: Our LDPE constructed caps are crack-resistant. Designed with a security ring, you’ll know right away if the bottle has been opened. The lipped lid makes it easy to remove our push-on cap and the sealed closure prevents leaks. Dishwasher Safe: Our glass milk container is dishwasher safe and even easy to clean by hand. You’ll never have to worry about our milk jug warping from heat like plastic. It’s also stain and odor resistant. The caps are *Not* dishwasher safe. Versatile: Our glass juice bottles can be used as storage for bathroom accessories like bath salts and soap. Use them in your kitchen to store dried goods like seasonings, tea leaves, and sugar, or in your fridge for any kind of liquid. Great Value Pack: Comes with 2 jars and 6 white caps. Each have a maximum capacity of 1 liter (1/4 gallon, or 32 oz normal capacity). Dimensions are approximately 8 ⅞” Height, 3 5/13” Length, and 3 5/13” Width.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715MDl5vwpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stock Your Home","source_asin":"B0BC25QQ7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC25QQ7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC25QQ7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
