window.products.push({"id":622113,"name":"LYERSE Faux Olive Tree 7ft - Tall Olive Trees Artificial Indoor - Large Fake Potted Olive Silk Tree Plant with Branches and Fruits - Artificial Tree f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cdyRmtiWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【All Year Round Decor】Our lifelike artificial plants will give your home a real boost. They never wilt and look fresh year after year. And if you keep a few artificial trees stored away, you can change them up with the seasons or brighten up a room anytime you want. It's a nice faux corner plant decoration for office house living room home indoor & outdoor. 【Unique Shape and Free Maintenance】Always forget watering your lovely plant? Tired of dead plants? Try these olive trees artificial indoor! You don't have to worry about watering it, no more dead olive tree plants. You will love how it brings life to your room without the added maintenance of a live plant. 【Sturdy and Adjustable】Our faux olive tree outfitted with sturdy inner metal wires, the branches and leaves themselves are adjustable so you can really craft your ideal artificial olive tree. This fake olive tree will maintain its height, color and shape for years without pruning and shaping to ensure the aesthetic is maintained. 【Safe Materials and Lifelike】This artificial olive tree is made of durable and premium silk material(real touch, waterproof, eco-friendly. The black nursery pot is made of hard PP material with cement poured inside which to prevent children, pets knock it down. we suggest to placing it in bigger decorative planter to make the fake tree be more perfect. 【Perfect Dimension】This tall faux olive plant is 10lbs, overall tree is 6ft height and 2.2ft width. The black nursery pot is 5 inch tall and 5.5-inch width. when you receive, artificial tree is divided into two sections. please align the arrows according to the stickers and splice them together. Just need only 2-3 minutes to shape it to reach its fullest size. They are also strong enough to support mini lights, a great addition for wedding ceremony, fireplace, party or event decor, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cdyRmtiWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LYERSE","source_asin":"B0BRXT82W9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXT82W9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXT82W9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":622114,"name":"Navien Mate EQM 350, King – EMF-Free Water Heated Mattress Pad – Dual Temperature Control – Non-Electric Bed Warmer – Eco-Friendly – Helps Soothe & Re","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":489.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VeZ1yQzzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"EMF-FREE. The easy-to-use Navien Mate EQM 350 heated mattress pad utilizes water heating technology to provide a more even heat without the risk of fire or overheating. Plus, there is no electromagnetic field (EMF) emitted from the heated pad itself. DUAL TEMPERATURE CONTROLS. The King and Queen sizes allow for separate heating zones so that each side can be personalized to your ideal sleep temperature for a restful night’s sleep. MAXIMUM QUIET COMFORT. Navien Mate mattress pads are incredibly thin with a 1 mm width, offering maximum comfort without poking wires. The heating unit is also very quiet. During operation, the total decibels are between 32 dB–34 dB. SOOTHING POWER OF WATER. Lightweight and portable, the Navien Mate is designed to help soothe the body through its water heated technology. This heated mattress warmer is ideal for users suffering from muscle and joint stiffness and soreness, tension, poor sleep, and more. ENERGY SAVING. Our eco-friendly technology is energy efficient, saving up to 50% compared to electric heating mattress pads by recirculating warm water so you can stay warm without high heating bills.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VeZ1yQzzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Navien Mate","source_asin":"B07YP1SJGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YP1SJGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YP1SJGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
