window.products.push({"id":622156,"name":"Yummy Can Potatoes SEEN-ON-TV, Enjoy a Perfectly Baked Microwave, Cooks in Minutes, Tender & Fluffy Spuds, Endless Potato-Possibilities, Easy to Clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eV5as3ulL._AC_.jpg","description":"Yummy Can Potatoes is the NEW way to make yummy, baked potatoes right in your microwave in minutes! No one likes waiting nearly an hour for potatoes to bake in the oven. Yummy Can makes it quick and easy. Simply place your potatoes on the specially-designed raised base, then pop it in the microwave. In just minutes, you’ll be enjoying America’s favorite baked side dish! Tender on the outside and oh-so-fluffy on the inside! Roast a potato incorrectly and it pops out burnt and dry. Microwave a potato by itself and it comes out mushy and dry. Yummy Can’s patent-pending value creates a steam pocket and the raised base lets the steam circulate for fast, even cooking. You’ll enjoy perfect potatoes in minutes! Yummy Can Potatoes makes it easy to prepare any type of potato! It’s easy to clean and easy to store thanks to its compact and lightweight design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eV5as3ulL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BulbHead","source_asin":"B0B5FRVJN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5FRVJN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5FRVJN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":622157,"name":"WASIOTE Metal Platform Bed Frame with Faux Leather Nail Head Trim Rustic Wood Headboard Footboard /Steel Slats Support/Easy Assembly/No Box Spring Nee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+79C3NIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We are committed to creating the highest quality household products. The thickened steel frame enhances the stability of the bed and greatly improves the carrying capacity. Soft faux leather headboard and pedals with studded headdress and decorative plumbing fittings create a delicate retro look. We choose high quality metal, not easy to shake, no noise, can bring you a good sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+79C3NIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WASIOTE","source_asin":"B09JSKYLK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JSKYLK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JSKYLK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":622158,"name":"Bodum Nissen Acrylic Pepper Grinder, Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TKYJYCEZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The perfect addition to any tablesetting, Bodum's Nissen Small Pepper Grinder brings fresh ground pepper to the table in a functional size and design. Clear acrylic is crafted into a contemporary kitchen and tableware collection to complement any style preference. The Nissen grinder is easy to use, both when cooking and garnishing your meal. Refilling the grinder is made simple with the convenient top filling design that makes it easy to add more pepper to the grinder. The durable carbon steel blade is fully adjustable with an easy to grip wing nut that adjusts the grind from fine to course. The smooth action and consistent grind will impress the your guests. The Bodum pepper grinders come filled with peppercorns, so your first few grinds are on us. Whether you are a professional chef or a novice cook, you will enjoy having these pieces both in your kitchen as a functional pepper grinder and on your table as a stylish accessory. Designed to last, the Nissen small grinder comes complete with a 10-year warranty. Purchase this grinder together with the Nissen Small Acrylic Salt Grinder for a matching set. Amazon.com Bodum, a family-owned company that wins awards for its well-designed coffee makers and kitchen products, sticks to the philosophy that \"good design doesn't have to be expensive.\" Building on its Danish modern roots, Bodum produces the Nissen line of pepper and salt grinders. Each is comprised of a clear, acrylic base that fits comfortably in the hand and lets you see how many peppercorns or salt crystals are left inside. A silver-toned cylindrical top provides a contemporary accent. Acrylic doesn't mean flimsy, however; the Nissen is so sturdy that Bodum covers the grinder with an impressive 10-year warranty. Available in three sizes, the Nissen pepper grinder is fitted with a sharp, long-lasting carbon steel blade that never needs sharpening. A wing-nut easily turns to adjust the grind, which can range from a fine dusting of pepper on soup to coarser shavings on salads or roast meat. The cylindrical top turns smoothly for quick action, and removes for handy top-filling. Bodum graciously fills the grinder with peppercorns to get you started. Pair the pepper grinder with a matching Nissen salt grinder for a contemporary tabletop set. The heights and diameters of the Nissen grinders are as follows: large, 13-1/2 by 3-1/4 inches; medium, 8-3/4 by 2-1/2 inches; small, 4-3/4 by 1-3/4 inches. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31TKYJYCEZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B000F5NJZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000F5NJZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000F5NJZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
