window.products.push({"id":622291,"name":"1 Gallon Glass Jar Beverage Dispenser with Stand, Durable Water Dispensers Countertop with Stainless Steel Leak-Free Spigot for Weddings Parties Sun T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hl4m2FXLL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Step your party game! Summer is not complete with a party, it is summer break why not gather everyone to have a hearty and lengthy chit chat. And a party is not complete with cold beverages. We know you hate repeatedly refilling your guests' drink, not to include all the spills created making cleaning a dreadful nightmare. That is why we have this cold brew coffee maker. Two reasons why our 1 gallon glass jar is a must-have party supplies: 1. No hustles - It is simple, all you need to do is pour your cold beverages then put a good amount of ice cubes, and voila! Your cold drinks are ready to fight the summer heat. No more spilling or leaking - 100% guaranteed. 2. For all drinks - The thick and clear food-grade glass with wide opening make this beverage dispenser with spigot suitable for all drinks, You can have one for juice dispenser, one for lemonade dispenser and one for sangria dispenser. Additionally, after the party ends, cleaning the glass water dispenser is easy-peasy. 1. Use liquid soap and a sponge to clean the inside 1 gallon drink dispenser. 2. Pour water and let the water flow out through the spigot. 3. Keep pouring water until all the soap is clear. After cleaning, you can put this glass drink dispenser with stand on top of your kitchen cabinet as a decorative piece. This luxurious, sleek, and classy designed glass beverage dispenser will make a perfect addition to your kitchenette. Oh, It is also possible to use this glass dispenser as your laundry soap dispenser. No need to worry about getting your liquid detergent stuck because our lid has a rubber cap to allow some air to get in. We can ensure you, everything will flow smoothly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hl4m2FXLL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfecto","source_asin":"B08QCLBD77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QCLBD77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QCLBD77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
