window.products.push({"id":622381,"name":"Simplogenic Spurtle Kitchen Tool Set,Premium Beechwood Cooking Utensils,4 pcs Wooden Spatula Set,Anti-Scratch,Heat Resistant,Natural Color,No Coating,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x1un9A0FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Traditional Design : Originated from Scotland, the Spurtle is one of those age-old kitchen accessories used for hundreds of years. Simplogenic has brought this multi-use beechwood spurtle set based on the traditional design. Limitless Usage, Multiple Sizes for Various Jobs : Simplogenic’s 4-piece Spurtle set includes- 13 inches x 2.3 inches slotted 13 inches x 2.3 inches solid 10 inches x 2 inches solid 8.75 inches x 2 inches solid Versatile usage of this spurtle set will definitely replace a bunch of other utensils in your kitchen. You can use this set for MIXING, FLIPPING, SCRAPING, STIRRING, SPREADING, SERVING, SCOOPING and many more! Ergonomically Crafted, Designed for Everyone : Our product is crafted with care to make you feel comfortable in your kitchen. This set is lightweight, smooth and feels good in your hand. No matter if you are a professional chef or a home cook, this set will make your life so easy! Protect your Precious Pots and Pans from Scratching : Thanks to the design of smooth and rounded shafts, your spurtle set will not damage your expensive pans and pots when cooking, no matter if they are made of stainless steel, aluminum, ceramic or non-stick surface. Beechwood, 100 Percent Organic : Simplogenic spurtle set is made with selected grade beechwood material. We do not apply any glue or color coating on our product to keep it organic. Beechwood is a safer alternative to silicone or plastic kitchen utensils. Unique Appearance : Each piece of our set is uniquely grained with natural texture patterns and graceful contour shapes. Please note that beechwood color represents the age of the wood. Whiter wood indicates younger wood, which darkens over time. Mark of Quality : Every piece of our spurtle set is marked with laser engraved logo of our, so you will never have a doubt about the authenticity and quality of our product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x1un9A0FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simplogenic","source_asin":"B08RBBPTK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RBBPTK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RBBPTK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
