window.products.push({"id":622400,"name":"Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set - Automatic, Battery Operated Stainless Steel Spice Mills with Light - One Handed Push Button Peppercorn Grinders","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Specifications: Material: stainless steel Size: 5.2 * 22cm Uses: Can grind pepper, pepper, coarse salt, sesame and other small particles of crisp foods, suitable for home kitchen, dining table, restaurants, hotels and so on. How to operate: Put on four AA batteries. Pull out the grinder and place it in the desired item. Press the button above to grind. The grinder works. The hand is released and the grinder stops working. Instructions for use: You can adjust the thickness of the pepper, just gently screw the top screw on OK. Tighten it tightly (can't screw too tightly), loosen it to be thick. Use as follows: Just put the lid open and put the pepper in it, then close the lid and turn the lid to get the pepper out. Easy to use, beautiful and practical. 1. After grinding, it can be directly sprinkled in cooking dishes, soups, stir-fries, fried rice, lo-mei, fried chicken, etc. 2. After grinding, it can be applied to fish and meat, and then placed on a barbecue grill. 3. Can help curry seasoning. 4. Help seasoning with cooking liquids, broth, salad dressing, and various sauces. Maintenance: After each use, use a sponge or a soft cloth to thoroughly clean and wipe dry to maintain the smoothness and hygiene of the stainless steel. If it is not thoroughly cleaned, a white film (mineral in water and starch in food) will appear on the surface of stainless steel, and it will also need to be scrubbed with lemon juice or white vinegar. Precautions: When using, do not heat directly on the stove to avoid burns. Package Include: 2 X Pepper Grinders","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alicedreamsky","source_asin":"B08LZHTP1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LZHTP1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LZHTP1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
