window.products.push({"id":622424,"name":"Jockey Box Conversion Kit Single Faucet, DIY Beer Keg Cooler, 3/8-inch 50' Stainless Steel Coil, Food Grade 304ss","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wUK39a38L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Jockey Box Conversion kit offers the perfect portable solution for dispensing ice cold keg beer anytime, anywhere! Make the Jockey Box you want with one, two or more faucets by purchasing one or more of these conversion kits. This is a DIY conversion kit, you will need your own cooler, 1” hole saw, and wrenches to assemble a complete Jockey Box. After constructing your Jockey Box, just connect a keg of warm beer and a CO2 tank to the back of the Jockey Box. Then fill the Jockey Box with ice. Finally, warm beer flows from the keg through 50’ of stainless steel coil and arrives deliciously chilled at the faucet. The stainless steel coil features a 3/8” outside diameter and is made with food grade 304ss material. A 3/8” outside diameter allows you to tap beer at a lower pressure for a perfect pour. Coils with smaller diameters (such as 5/16” or 1/4\") require higher tap pressure, resulting in foamy inconsistent pours. Stainless steel coils are preferable over cold plates because the coils are longer allowing more time for the beer to chill. Includes: One 3/8” OD 50' stainless steel coil, 3\" wall shank with 1/4” barbed nipple, 3\" faucet shank, chrome faucet, black faucet handle, faucet wrench, and all necessary fittings. Comes with 1/4” barbed nipples ready to connect to your beer and air lines. Beer line, air line, regulator, CO2 tank, and cooler NOT INCLUDED.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wUK39a38L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JockeyBox.com","source_asin":"B00WQAYFC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WQAYFC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WQAYFC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":622425,"name":"FuhlSpeed KPB-27 Popcorn Ball Microwavable Popcorn Maker/Mixer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k7YWoSDvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you interested in perfectly seasoned popcorn every time how about eliminating the process of making popcorn in a bag that becomes super hot and then pouring it into a bowl with this microwavable popcorn Ball, you can place your popcorn kernels directly inside and microwave until they are all popped. After you take it out of the microwave, all you have to do is open the lid and pour in whatever toppings you'd like. Then, close the lid and spin the Ball using the two finger divots on the sides of the Ball. Open up the top of the Ball and enjoy perfectly distributed ingredients. While you're not eating the popcorn, have fun rolling the Ball around and knowing that your butter, seasoning, or other favorite toppings are constantly covering every kernel. If popcorn isn't your thing, toss some trail mix or salad in the Ball and use it the same way to mix all your ingredients. The bottom of the Ball even has a turbulator to ensure the toppings go all the way through the mix rather than staying on the sides. Now, get creative and mix up some great snacks either for yourself or for the family","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k7YWoSDvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FuhlSpeed","source_asin":"B0171CA3CY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0171CA3CY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0171CA3CY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
