window.products.push({"id":622488,"name":"Millvado Granite 21 Qt Stockpot, Nonstick Soup Pot With Lid, Speckled Enamel Ware Cookware , Large Stock Pot For Boiling and Cooking , Big Granite Coo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71djvYsZ-1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE STOCK POT: With a capacity of 21 quarts, this deep pot is the perfect size for cooking up a jumbo batch of chili, gumbo, or beans, slow simmering your favorite soup or stew, or steaming lobster or other seafood for a crowd. It's makes a great canner, too - large enough to fit lots of jars at once! This lightweight yet durable pot heats up quickly and distributes that heat well, making for faster and more efficient cooking times. NATURALLY NONSTICK: Stock pots are carefully crafted with a core of carbon steel, then covered on the inside and outside with a layer of natural enamel. With these black and white speckled stoneware pots, you get the benefits of non stick without having to worry about chemicals! Does not react to acidic foods, either. SUITABLE FOR OUTDOOR USE: This large enamel boiling pot works great on outdoor stoves, camp stoves, grills, and open fires. It's lightweight and easy to carry - perfect for camping! Be sure to bring along a potholder, too, as the handles do get hot. HEALTHY COOKING: These nonstick pots are 100% natural and chemical-free, so you don't have to worry about nasty stuff going into your food. Plus, your enameled pot will not stain or retain flavors or odors from previous cooking sessions. DISHWASHER SAFE: When you are finished cooking, just toss this big nonstick stew pot into the dishwasher and let the machine work its magic. If you prefer to hand wash, simply wipe down with a paper towel and rinse under warm, soapy water. Wipe dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71djvYsZ-1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Millvado","source_asin":"B0BF95Z96H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF95Z96H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF95Z96H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":622489,"name":"Best Brands Disney Minnie Mouse Silicone Turner - This Minnie Mouse Disney Spatula is Ideal for Turning Food - Perfect for any Disney Fan - Red, Measu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+TpUICTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Disney Minnie Mouse Silicone TurnerThis adorable Minnie Mouse hand turner makes a perfect gift for any Disney fan that loves to cook or bake. Officially licensed, this silicone plastic turner features the classic Minnie Mouse design, as pictured.Add some Disney flair to the kitchen, this hand turner is helpful for many kitchen tasks including turning food such as pancakes.Presented with a giftable tag as pictured, perfect as a stocking stuffer. See our line of Disney kitchen accessories and decor to find a special gift for the Disney fan in your life. Silicone head and handle, measuring approx. 11 inches (L).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+TpUICTwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best Brands","source_asin":"B08QDRQS6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QDRQS6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QDRQS6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":622490,"name":"Waratah All-Natural Merino Wool/Pima Cotton Full/Queen Somersoft Blanket, Denim Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FloXW2JnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Waratah all-natural 100-percent Australian merino wool/pima cotton full/queen size somersoft blanket-merino wool is known as natures best insulator and high performance fabric. The wool comes from the merino sheep of Australia who are regarded as having the finest and softest wool of any sheep in the world. Because merino wool fibers are smaller in diameter and more numerous than coarser wools, it makes merino one of the softest, most durable and dense types of wool available. The merino wool/cotton somersoft blanket is constructed at waratah woollen mills founded in 1874 in Tasmania Australia which is Australia's oldest textile mill, and still operating from its original site. The benefits of the merino wool/pima cotton blanket are that it has an amazing warmth-to-weight ratio making it a perfect temperature regulating blanket that will keep you warmer in the winter and cooler in the summer. Waratah woollen mills rigorously avoids the use of chemicals in production of our wool blankets and we make sure that all of our products are manufactured from 100-percent all-natural components making an already perfect blanket healthy. This luxurious full/queen size blanket measures 90 by 94-inch and includes a 2-inch self hem to add strength and give it a clean crisp edge. The somersoft blankets unique combination of merino wool and combed pima cotton allow superb and even sleeping due to its breathability. The somersoft blanket is meant as a 3-season in the north/4-season in the south blanket. It's perfect to use when a heavy blanket is too warm or in conjunction with other bedding. Also makes an awesome couch snuggling blanket. Warm hand wash or machine wash on wool cycle. Dry cleanable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FloXW2JnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waratah USA","source_asin":"B004VL16VQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004VL16VQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004VL16VQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
