window.products.push({"id":622543,"name":"Mid-Century Modern TV Stand for 55 inch TV Entertainment Center Wood TV Console Media Cabinet with 4 Storages for Living Room Bedroom, 50 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KpASGn7SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Mid-Century Modern TV Stand】This retro TV stand is large enough to accommodate TVs up to 55 inch, of course, it is also suitable for 43”, 50”, 55” flat screen. Crafted from unique appearance and exquisite craftsmanship, the 50 inch tv stand will be a perfect addition in your living room or bedroom, and also can be used as a storage cabinet, entryway table etc. Overall dimension: 43.3 L x 15.6 W x 20.9 H 【Open & Hidden Storage Space】Designed with 2 cubby and 1 storage cabinet, the TV stand for 55 inch TV provides large storage space to put books, CDs, set-top boxes and remote controls in order. It's worth mentioning that the shelf can be adjusted to 3 heights to facilitate the placement of items of different heights. 【Powerful Cable Management】There are 2 cable management holes on the back of the wood entertainment center, which is convenient for you to organize the wires of audio-visual equipment. The cabinet door of the TV console table could be opened with a gentle press, making it effortlessly to pick up things inside. Additionally, the distance under the media cabinet is large enough so that robot vacuum cleaner can pass freely. 【Easy to Assemble & Clean】With detailed instruction and all hardware delivered, the brown tv table is effortless to assemble. And its smooth waterproof surface is easy to clean with a soft damp cloth, which is effortless for your daily cleaning work. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will try our best to provide professional service. 【Easy to Assemble & Clean】This wood tv table comes with a clear instruction, which has straight forward illustrations and descriptions. Each screw and pin has its own code to let you easily understand the assembly progress. In addition, its smooth surface is waterproof and easy to keep clean with a damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KpASGn7SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAMPAT","source_asin":"B0C33GCCSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C33GCCSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C33GCCSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":622544,"name":"Tirrito SC Lifestyle All Purpose Bag Tote w/Zipper Pocket & Carabiner- Use As A Beach Bag or Grocery Bag (Red/White/Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1teyslpViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The SC Lifestyle beach bag is the perfect companion for your day at the beach. Made of a heavy duty mesh-like material, the bag is durable and heavy duty to carry everything you need. In addition to a huge main compartment that can carry up to 6 beach towels, the bag also has an additional 5 outer pockets for water bottles, swimming goggles, and sunblock. The bag also sports an extra interior pocket with a zipper where you can store all of your valuables for safekeeping. Finally, there is a handy carabiner where you can hang your keys for easy access. The bag is fully guaranteed and comes with a lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1teyslpViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOOBOSS","source_asin":"B01F1HD2YC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F1HD2YC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F1HD2YC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":622545,"name":"Herb Garden Placemats, Set of 4, Cork Backed Board, Heat Resistant, Rustic Home Style, 16 x 11 1/4 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TX56rJUcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOLD AS A SET OF FOUR: Set your table with our Herb Garden Placemats. Whether you're entertaining indoors or out, add a dash of garden green herbs with these casual and colorful placemats. EASY TO CLEAN: The set of 4 is a cinch to clean. Simply wipe off messes with a damp cloth. GREAT SIZE: 16 X 11 ¼ INCHES The laminated tops feature green sprigs of basil, rosemary and mint at center with the words IN THE KITCHEN at top and HERBARIUM at the bottom. Hand drawn pencil sketches of rustic villas symmetrically balance the beautifully depicted herbs at center of the printed graphic. Framed by a green stripes that echo the rectangular shape, these placemats are meant for everyday meals at dining tables and countertops alike. CRAFTED from high quality ¼ inch thick cork backed board. AN IDEAL GIFT, it's perfect to celebrate holidays, birthdays, weddings and many more. So gorgeous, you'll want to keep it at home for yourself. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TX56rJUcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B06WLJ6GCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-622545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WLJ6GCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WLJ6GCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
